Error [jet.ValueNotSendable]: `parallel item` can't cross a parallel worker boundary because `CallbackPayload` isn't sendable
  --> Tests/UI/Closures/parallel_adapters_reject_unsafe_boundaries_before_codegen_7.jet:11:23
    |
 11 |     ignored: payloads.para_map(fn(payload: CallbackPayload) { 1 })
    |                       ^^^^^^^^
 Why: A function value carries executable state, not a worker data value; this concurrent boundary moves owned values between workers
 Fix: Copy plain owned data into the worker, or keep this operation sequential
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1102
